  "description": "Public form-submission endpoints for mikser-io. Receives JSON or multipart/form-data over HTTP, runs validation + captcha, and writes the result as a document file plus optional file uploads. Files-as-source-of-truth — the documents/files plugins pick up the writes on their own.",
